architecture-beta
accTitle: Account and security strategy for a serverless data platform - AWS reference reconstruction
accDescr: Eleven AWS account roles from the AWS reference, including management, security, network, production analytics, ML sandbox, audit, dashboards, DevOps, analytics sandbox, ingestion and shared services. Account inventories without reference arrows are not wired with invented runtime dependencies.
%% Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/reference-architecture-diagrams/latest/account-security-data-platform/account-security-data-platform.html
%% Labels modernize Master to Management, AWS SSO to IAM Identity Center and Elasticsearch to OpenSearch.
group aws(cloud)[AWS Cloud]
group management(cloud)[1 - Management account] in aws
group security(cloud)[2 - Security account] in aws
