%% The original has no arrows wiring management/security/network/shared inventories to every account.
sourceBatch:B --> B:transfer
sourceEvents:R --> L:streams
transfer:T --> B:batch
streams:R --> B:firehose
firehose:B --> T:realtime
streams:T --> L:workflow
workflow:R --> B:realtime
workflow:B --> B:search
%% Lambda inventory is retained without inventing a sequential workflow interior.
