api:B <--> T:ecs
ecs:B <--> T:dynamo
prediction:L --> R:ecs
deployment:L --> R:prediction
monitoring:L --> R:deployment
emr:T --> B:dynamo
athena:T <--> B:deployment
quick:L --> R:redshift
biTools:B --> B:redshift
debugger:R --> L:training
ground:L --> R:checking
checking:L --> R:training
training:B --> T:deployment
